.github
.gitleaks*
docs
**/node_modules
frontend/build
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.sqlite3
mistyrose/staticfiles
mistyrose/media
.venv
venv
# secrets and local settings never go into an image
.env
*.env
**/.env*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
